OL,3,GNEWSAStrikes to halt weekend trams
OL,4,Aduring Goose Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo trams will run for two weekends
OL,7,Fduring Nottingham's historic Goose Fair
OL,8,Fdue to strikes, it has been announced.
OL,10,FIndustrial action is due to take place
OL,11,Fover eight days from Saturday - a day
OL,12,Fafter the annual event at Forest
OL,13,FRecreation Ground gets under way. It
OL,14,Fwill also coincide with the Robin Hood
OL,15,FHalf Marathon on Sunday.
OL,17,FThe city's tram operator Nottingham
OL,18,FExpress Transit (NET) previously said
OL,19,Fthe move followed nine months of pay
OL,20,Fdiscussions and negotiations, including
OL,21,Fa pay offer in June that was rejected
OL,22,Fby the union GMB.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
